---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy | DecoSupplier" description="How DecoSupplier uses essential and optional cookies, including consent controls and browser settings.">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 md:py-16 lg:px-8">
    <header class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-8">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary-700)]">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: August 14, 2026</p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">This policy explains how DecoSupplier uses cookies and similar browser technologies on this website and how you can control them.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-10 py-10 text-slate-700">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">1. What Cookies Are</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">Cookies are small text files stored by your browser. They can remember settings, support security, measure website performance, and help website operators understand how pages are used.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">2. Cookies We Use</h2>
        <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto border border-slate-200">
          <table class="w-full min-w-[640px] border-collapse text-left text-sm">
            <thead class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900">
              <tr><th class="border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Category</th><th class="border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Purpose</th><th class="border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Control</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 font-medium">Essential</td><td class="border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-3">Security, server operation, inquiry forms, and remembering your consent choice.</td><td class="border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-3">Required for requested website functions.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 font-medium">Analytics</td><td class="border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-3">Aggregated information about visits, traffic sources, devices, and page interactions.</td><td class="border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-3">Used only when enabled and consent is provided.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Functional</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Optional preferences that improve convenience or remember selected settings.</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Used when the related feature is enabled.</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">3. Consent Choice</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">When you select “Accept,” this website stores your acceptance in the browser so the consent notice does not appear again. Selecting “Reject” closes the notice for the current page only; it will appear again after you refresh or navigate to another page.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">You can withdraw acceptance by clearing this website's local storage and cookies in your browser. The consent notice will then appear again.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">4. Third-Party Technologies</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">If analytics, embedded media, maps, chat, or other external services are enabled, their providers may place or read cookies under their own policies. We review such services before activation and limit their use to the website functions they support.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">5. Browser Controls</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">Most browsers allow you to view, block, or delete cookies through privacy settings. Blocking essential storage may affect forms, preferences, security, or other website functions.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">6. Updates and Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">We may update this policy as website technology changes. Questions about cookies or privacy may be submitted through our <a href="/contact" class="font-medium text-[var(--color-primary-700)] underline underline-offset-2">Contact page</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
